{
  "format": "hsvg/2.1-draft",
  "kind": "capability-draft",
  "id": "effects",
  "about": {
    "title": "Effect kinds after particles",
    "description": "A 2.1 draft, outside the 2.0 registry (decision 3 after R2): the effect kinds spring, aim, follow, limit and dynamics, with their grammar as 2.0 had it. 2.0 runs only particles.",
    "version": "2.1.0-draft"
  },
  "adds": [
    "the effect kinds spring, aim, follow, limit, dynamics and particles for the effects map of a block (A1.1)",
    "springs and dynamics advance in fixed 120 Hz steps on the owner's clock with at most 12 catch-up steps: velocity += acceleration * dt, then position += velocity * dt, dt = 1/120",
    "at most 16 effects per block; at most 32 dynamics bodies per block; unknown kinds and keys are refused",
    "spring: a damped spring on one channel toward to; defaults rest 0, stiffness 100, damping 15; acceleration = stiffness * (to - position) - damping * velocity",
    "aim: turns target about its pivot toward the point at (block drawing coordinates); rest is the angle in degrees the part faces as drawn; the written rotate offset is the angle to the point minus rest, clamped to limits (degrees from rest) and multiplied by weight (default 1)",
    "follow: copies the current offset of part 'of' on the same channel into target, clamped to limits",
    "limit: writes the value of the formula, clamped to limits, to the channel",
    "dynamics: scalar bodies, one channel each, never bones; a body owns its part's whole transform; acceleration = force + w*w*(goal - position) - (2*damping*w + drag)*velocity with w = 2*pi*springHz; velocity is clamped to +-100000; the two ends of range are walls that reverse outward velocity times bounce; a parent names the part of an earlier body on the same channel and needs springHz above 0: its goal is the parent's previous position plus its own to; squash-stretch writes scale-x = x and scale-y = 1/x; the range lies inside the part's motion range (scale channels inside 0.25..4); reducedMotion rest shows the first row, finish the final simulated row"
  ],
  "grammar": {
    "effectKinds": {
      "spring": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
              "spring"
            ]
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 48
          },
          "channel": {
            "enum": [
              "translate-x",
              "translate-y",
              "rotate",
              "scale",
              "scale-x",
              "scale-y",
              "opacity"
            ]
          },
          "to": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": -1000000,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4096
              }
            ]
          },
          "rest": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": -1000000,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4096
              }
            ]
          },
          "stiffness": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0.01,
                "maximum": 1000
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4096
              }
            ]
          },
          "damping": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 100
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4096
              }
            ]
          },
          "start": {
            "enum": [
              "entry",
              "play"
            ]
          },
          "durationMs": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 600000
          },
          "reducedMotion": {
            "enum": [
              "rest",
              "finish"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "kind",
          "target",
          "channel",
          "to",
          "reducedMotion"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "aim": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
              "aim"
            ]
          },
          "target": {
